# Item flagged by the September 2026 independent re-review: this repo had no
# .gitignore at all, which is both an ordinary hygiene gap and a real risk
# here specifically - AuthScaffold.ts writes a live authenticated browser
# session (cookies/storage state) to .auth/session.json, which must never be
# committed.

# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Playwright output
test-results/
playwright-report/
blob-report/
all-blob-reports/
.auth/

# Continuous-improvement loop artifacts - regenerated, not source (see
# .github/skills/continuous-improvement/SKILL.md). Keep these local/CI-only,
# not committed, so history doesn't turn into repeated merge noise.
.flaky-trend/
flaky-trend.json
skill-corrections.jsonl
skill-attention-report.json
heal-report.json
script-review-report.json

# Build output
dist/

# Editor/OS noise
.DS_Store
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# Learning loop (see .github/skills/fix-knowledge-base/SKILL.md). The raw events in
# .learnings/events/ and the approved patterns in .learnings/patterns/ ARE committed;
# these are regenerated reports and CI scratch.
learning-report.json
learning-report.md
learning-events/
learning-store/
